# UdyamAI Data & Source Registry

This document contains the complete source registry referenced in the Stage 1 proposal.

Sources are classified according to their role in the research.

---

## Source Role Legend

| Role | Meaning |
|---|---|
| GROUND TRUTH | Direct business-level evidence |
| CORE INPUT | Primary model input |
| CONTEXT | Indian economic/business context |
| EXPERIMENTAL | Candidate external signal |
| BENCHMARK | Methodology testing only |
| GOVERNANCE | Data/privacy/security framework |

---

# S01 — PIB MSME Economic Context

**Role:** CONTEXT

**Source:** Press Information Bureau — Ministry of MSME

**Purpose:**
