# S11 — GST GSTR-1

**Role:** POTENTIAL CORE BUSINESS INPUT

**Source:** GST official documentation

GSTR-1 contains outward-supply information, including relevant invoice and credit/debit-note information.

**Potential use:**

Where legitimately available and consented, GST data may contribute evidence about business sales/invoicing.

**Critical limitation:**

GST invoice information is not equivalent to cash received.

Therefore:

> GST ≠ cash flow

Invoices, receivables and collections must remain separate in the data model.

**Official source:**

https://tutorial.gst.gov.in/userguide/returns/Creation_of_Outward_Supplies_Return_in_GSTR-1.htm

